      "value": "@{678fd947b51d3c4f77851d07|full_name} \"As you yourself stated, you can set the volume to 0 if you don't want to have an icon, or block to prevent all harassment.\" as just a example: blocking people on a game world makes the game world overall worse for you and them.\n\nas i also did state: \"but sometimes you can see someone frequently and just not want to have to do that constantly.\" as a further example to that: switching instances, groups tend to bounce from a to b and having to constantly set their volume to 0 can get annoying.\n\n\"I like the mute icon because not always am I muting them for a negative reason and it lets them know they need to get my attention for me to hear them.\" as stated it would be an option so if you want to show people that you have them muted just keep the setting off.",
