  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "pain point: someone is being annoying and you want to mute them (the whole point to the feature) and 9/10 times they're gonna get pissy and probably start to try and harass or get you removed from the instance for not wanting to hear them. (eg. 3 people blasting entirely different music, its headache inducing.)\n\nfeature: option to turn off the icon entirely so muting people and keeping them muted isn't a hassle, you can just set their volume to 0 but sometimes you can see someone frequently and just not want to have to do that constantly.",
